menu "M5Stack Core2"

config CORE2_ROTATE_180
    bool "Turn the screen and touch 180 degrees"
    default n
    help
        Off: M5Stack's standard orientation (MADCTL 0x08, touch as reported), with the
        touch strip for the three buttons below the screen. On: the device held the other
        way up, picture and touch turned together.

endmenu
